Notebook[{Cell["NumberOfGenerator", "ObjectName"], 
  Cell["NumberOfGenerator[r] returns the number of generator matrices of the \
representation value r.", "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Returns the number of generator matrices, which equals the number of \
recorded generators of the group the value belongs to. Rep[{}, d] has none.", 
   "Notes"], Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Rep", BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", 
